 or PLC in Kennebec County","/arc-plc/maine/kennebec-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids March to April came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them. In 2025, July to August came in at 48% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. So far in 2026, January to February sat at 45% of normal there. Grid 29343 had its driest year in 2001 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
